<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>Agent = Model + Harness</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 400, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 32, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", lineHeight: 1.2}}>Agent</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 32, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8}}>=</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.15, marginTop: 8}}>Model</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 32, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8}}>+</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.15, marginTop: 8}}>Harness</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 728, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>五层过完，公式才给：模型之外的一切，都是 harness。</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>成熟度标尺</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>前三门实、后两门虚：Loop / Graph Engineering 是 2026 才冒头的新兴叙事，不是既定范式。</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5}}>下一步：模型外面那一圈里头，具体有什么。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>12 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
